  "claims": [
    {
      "id": "claim_296e0d856a724b289d54978fdb6bd049",
      "statement": "launchenv.py defines four per-item proxy classification modes with fixed launch meanings: `proxied` means the pod holds a placeholder while the real value is injected at the wire (the goal state); `passthrough` means the pod holds the real value, a deliberate opt-out via `@proxy=passthrough`; `placeholder` means the item is sensitive but has no rule, so it reaches neither the pod nor any upstream (BROKEN); and `omit` means resolution failed and the item is withheld from the child entirely (BROKEN). The last two are why the launch-time warning exists (issue #388, finding F1), because varlock treats every item as sensitive by default so an unclassified item silently degrades to a real-looking placeholder that no upstream accepts and the failure surfaces far away as a 401.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/harnessed/launchenv.py#L55-L65",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:1128f20dbdae13b70c3b30d833062236d812652ffbd2504bf843c433337c52b4:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_0e44438c294646998fec7a311e2d39f1",
      "statement": "`_schema_declares_proxy` is a text gate, not a parse: it performs one file read of the entry `.env.schema` and returns whether `_PROXY_ANNOTATION_RE` (`@proxy(?:Config)?\\s*[(=]`) matches. It matches the annotation forms — `@proxy(domain=...)`, `@proxy=passthrough`, `@proxyConfig={egress=...}` — and not the bare word, because the only thing on the other side of the gate is a `varlock proxy rules` subprocess that RESOLVES values and can sit on a 1Password unlock prompt for up to `_VARLOCK_TIMEOUT` (60 seconds). A prose mention such as `# TODO: add @proxy after the migration` used to pass this gate and buy that resolving subprocess for a schema that had opted into nothing; a schema with no `@proxy` anywhere is every schema shipped today, so the gate keeps `proxy rules` off the critical path for everyone else.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/harnessed/launchenv.py#L269-L293",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:eca52f5f61b1be2975eb0f535e722a4881ba6504af6febe2eb7dddcc9b5d7835:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/harnessed/launchenv.py#L43-L46",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:cac6a1cd030fb496880eab645a66c30c5e0d5010416f0180f4de63a6d01507c6:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/harnessed/launchenv.py#L73-L87",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:f1c805784a03c0cbb9fb018b79a4da9a96ae58bbc7470924c199f8a0bd44aaec:"
        }
