      "id": "claim_1ec402d4715443ee9fba0718de908c0e",
      "statement": "The credential proxy migration itself is open work, not landed behaviour: ROADMAP.md tracks \"Host-anchored runtime secrets over `varlock proxy`, so a container resolves a secret without ever holding the backend credential\" under issue #388. The shipped `.env.schema.example` carries no `@proxy` annotation, consistent with the source's statement that a schema with no `@proxy` is every schema shipped today.",
